    "body_html": "<p><span>This sleeper sectional is ready for anything, whether lounging, napping, or hosting surprise guests! Upholstered in buttery Italian full-grain leather that gains a rich patina over time, it’s as timeless as it is cozy. The hotel-grade pull-out bed and tri-layered mattress promise premium sleep, while feather-down cushions make every seat feel VIP.</span></p>\n<!--split-->\n<ul>\n<li><span>Full-grain, pure aniline-dyed, Italian-tanned leather upholstery.</span></li>\n<li><span>Chocolate Brown features a non-pigmented leather, accentuating the natural beauty of the hide. The leather will scuff and develop into a beautiful vintage patina with use.</span></li>\n<li><span>Each hide is unique and will vary in depth of color.</span></li>\n<li><span>The pull-out bed frame boasts a commercial-grade quality, equivalent to those used in hotels.</span></li>\n<li><span>Under-chaise storage compartment with a smooth, controlled open-and-close hinge.</span></li>\n<li><span>Kiln-dried solid wood and engineered hardwood frame with reinforced joinery, ensuring longevity.</span></li>\n<li><span>Pirelli webbing suspension back support.</span></li>\n<li><span>Seat cushions are filled with a high-resilience foam core wrapped in feathers &amp; fiber.</span></li>\n<li><span>Back cushions are filled with a feather &amp; fiber blend.</span></li>\n<li><span>Loose, non-reversible seat and back cushions with removable zip-off covers.</span></li>\n<li><span>Solid wood legs in a walnut finish.</span></li>\n<li>",
